zubr: zubr (LALR(1) parser generator)
zubr:
zubr: ZUBR is a LALR(1) parser generator for building syntax analyzers
zubr: from user-written grammar specifications.
zubr: Its specification language is historically compatible with AT&T Yacc
zubr: and Berkeley Yacc, with additional ZUBR extensions.
zubr: Input and output text is UTF-8; internal text processing uses UCS-2.
zubr: The current implementation uses LibMPU and LibMPUIO.
zubr:
zubr: Homepage: https://git.radix-linux.su/prog/zubr.git/
